OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACut screen time in classrooms to avoid
OL,4,Along-term health issues, government
OL,5,Aurged
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe amount of time children in England
OL,8,Fspend on screens at school could be
OL,9,Fharming their "physical and
OL,10,Fdevelopmental health", a group of more
OL,11,Fthan 150 clinicians has warned.
OL,13,FGPs, paediatricians and other
OL,14,Fspecialists said in an open letter to
OL,15,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell and
OL,16,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper that
OL,17,Ftablets and laptops are being used
OL,18,Fwithout a full understanding of their
OL,19,Flong-term health impacts, including on
OL,20,Feye health.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
