OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACut screen time in classrooms to avoid
OL,4,Along-term health issues, government
OL,5,Aurged
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe clinicians said they are
OL,8,Fprescribing glasses, hearing aids and
OL,9,Fspeech therapy to children "for a
OL,10,Fproblem that is unintentionally being
OL,11,Fmade worse in our schools".
OL,13,FThe government said it was consulting
OL,14,Fon screen time guidance for children
OL,15,Faged five to 18 but that technology
OL,16,Fcould be a powerful learning tool if
OL,17,Fused properly.
